#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:22
#: fcef6803e1e64e62ae15f5fc9327326b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot already has numerous possible sources for temperature reports: "
"ESCs, Smart Batteries, Motor EFI and these independent sensors can be used "
"to replace those devices temperature reports which already exist in "
"ArduPilot. They can also just be logged."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 已有众多可能的温度报告来源：电调、智能电池、电机 EFI，这些独立传感器可用于替换 ArduPilot "
"中已存在的设备温度报告，也可仅记录日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:25
#: e7e1dca6e66b4c03923e8b8566e58dee
msgid "I2C Sensor Setup"
msgstr "I2C 传感器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:27
#: 3b4a5c798ecf4088bf76fdb7e0e0aad3
msgid ""
"Attach the sensor to one of the autopilot's I2C ports using SDA and SCL "
"pins. Then set (examples shown for the first sensor):"
msgstr "使用 SDA 和 SCL 引脚将传感器连接到飞控的某个 I2C 端口。然后设置（以第一个传感器为例）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:29
#: 14076e5eaaa24013b323b079479d355b
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_TYPE<TEMP1_TYPE>` = 0:Disabled, 1:TSYS01, 2:MCP9600, 3:MAX31865,"
" 4: TSYS03, 7: MLX90614"
msgstr ""
":ref:`TEMP1_TYPE<TEMP1_TYPE>` = "
"0：禁用，1：TSYS01，2：MCP9600，3：MAX31865，4：TSYS03，7：MLX90614"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:30
#: fbf90c037c9845ab8d617f9742338f5c
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_BUS<TEMP1_BUS>` = the I2C port on which the sensor is attached "
"(0-3)."
msgstr ":ref:`TEMP1_BUS<TEMP1_BUS>` = 传感器所连接的 I2C 端口（0-3）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:31
#: 08c690d72b6a4cac89303472fd3c9a1a
msgid ":ref:`TEMP1_ADDR<TEMP1_ADDR>` = the sensor's I2C address (0-127)."
msgstr ":ref:`TEMP1_ADDR<TEMP1_ADDR>` = 传感器的 I2C 地址（0-127）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:32
#: 0b4a455da80f42f2a77fc6246c9b4792
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_SRC<TEMP1_SRC>` = the temperature reporting device type that "
"should have its temperature report replaced with this sensor's."
msgstr ":ref:`TEMP1_SRC<TEMP1_SRC>` = 应将其温度报告替换为本传感器的温度报告设备类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:33
#: 9488724d81f1447dbcf3a1db0ab6f488
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_SRC_ID<TEMP1_SRC_ID>` = identifies the individual device, of the"
" above type, that should have its report replaced."
msgstr ":ref:`TEMP1_SRC_ID<TEMP1_SRC_ID>` = 标识上述类型中应替换其报告的具体设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:35
#: 2976fa191308419d9d90267c3e7017d7
msgid ""
"Each I2C device on any single bus must have a unique address. If more than "
"one of the same type of I2C temperature sensor is used, ensure each is "
"configured with a unique address. Some breakout boards include jumpers for "
"this purpose. Refer to the product datasheet for specific instructions "
"regarding I2C address configuration."
msgstr ""
"同一总线上的每个 I2C 设备必须具有唯一地址。如果使用多个相同类型的 I2C "
"温度传感器，请确保每个传感器配置了唯一地址。某些分线板包含用于此目的的跳线。请参阅产品数据手册了解 I2C 地址配置的具体说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:37
#: d396ffc6101f4a6cb35f7d749afda423
msgid ""
"The MAX31865 is an SPI device, which uses the same parameters and basic "
"configuration procedure as I2C sensors but must be connected to an SPI port "
"rather than an I2C port. Some autopilots do not expose an external SPI port,"
" in which case the MAX31865 cannot be easily used."
msgstr ""
"MAX31865 是一种 SPI 设备，使用与 I2C 传感器相同的参数和基本配置流程，但必须连接到 SPI 端口而非 I2C 端口。部分飞控没有外露的"
" SPI 端口，在这种情况下 MAX31865 无法轻松使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:39
#: 8a6740de05ee47fa9257fc5d8b0b0b21
msgid ""
"The MLX90614 sensor is an infrared thermometer for non-contact temperature "
"measurements. Its I2C address is 90 so :ref:`TEMP1_ADDR<TEMP1_ADDR>` = 90 "
"for this type of sensor."
msgstr ""
"MLX90614 传感器是一种用于非接触式温度测量的红外测温仪。其 I2C 地址为 90，因此对于此类传感器 "
":ref:`TEMP1_ADDR<TEMP1_ADDR>` = 90。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:42
#: 180b14f00e9544c58216e242de698bda
msgid "Analog Sensor Setup"
msgstr "模拟传感器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:44
#: 6616631f4ddf40a9b4edd2c0c0f5f538
msgid ""
"Attach the sensor to an analog input pin (an unused rssi input, analog "
"airspeed input, battery voltage input, or current monitor input pin, for "
"example). The pin number can be determined from the autopilot's wiki page. "
"Use care not to exceed the pin's rated voltage (typically 3.3 volts) with "
"the sensor output. Then set (examples shown for the first sensor):"
msgstr ""
"将传感器连接到模拟输入引脚（例如未使用的 RSSI 输入、模拟空速输入、电池电压输入或电流监测输入引脚）。引脚编号可从飞控的 wiki "
"页面确定。注意不要超过引脚的额定电压（通常为 3.3V）。然后设置（以第一个传感器为例）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:46
#: 888f2698bc364b26a45d7f5c1ed0c237
msgid ":ref:`TEMP1_TYPE<TEMP1_TYPE>` = 5 : Analog"
msgstr ":ref:`TEMP1_TYPE<TEMP1_TYPE>` = 5：模拟"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:47
#: 2f5f8a4ea6bc4b3ba7be47ad68e72ec4
msgid ""
":ref:`TEMP1_PIN<TEMP1_PIN>` = the analog pin number (for example: "
"2:Pixhawk/Pixracer/Navio2/Pixhawk2_PM1, 5:Navigator, "
"13:Pixhawk2_PM2/CubeOrange_PM2, 14:CubeOrange, 16:Durandal, 100:PX4-v1, "
"etc.)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`TEMP1_PIN<TEMP1_PIN>` = "
"模拟引脚编号（例如：2:Pixhawk/Pixracer/Navio2/Pixhawk2_PM1，5:Navigator，13:Pixhawk2_PM2/CubeOrange_PM2，14:CubeOrange，16:Durandal，100:PX4-v1，等）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:49
#: 27a116d886614c3bab79b022792b0c86
msgid ""
"The output voltage vs temperature curve of the sensor can be adjusted to "
"match its characteristic via a polynomial (up to 4th order). Fit the curve "
"via the product datasheet, a spreadsheet application, MATLAB, Python/numpy, "
"etc:"
msgstr ""
"传感器的输出电压与温度曲线可通过多项式（最高4阶）进行调整以匹配其特性。可通过产品数据手册、电子表格软件、MATLAB、Python/numpy "
"等工具拟合曲线："

#: ../../source/docs/common-temperature-sensor.rst:51
#: c9128ecbd8ac471baf5023b224a81c58
msgid "``deg = a0 + a1*voltage + a2*voltage^2 + a3*voltage^3 + a4*voltage^4``"
msgstr ""
"``deg = a0 + a1*voltage + a2*voltage^2 + a3*voltage^3 + a4*voltage^4``"

